  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"为买笔记本攒钱中！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W6Xlp26Z/images/2a6e8a58eabac85320c1a70fa1f1ffb6a63caa27.png\" alt=\"Crate Delight：Croptopia\"></p>\n<p><strong><br>通过为 Croptopia 添加存储方案来扩展 Crate Delight！</strong><br>本 <strong>Crate Delight</strong> 插件添加了专用的箱子和袋子，用于存放所有 <strong>Croptopia</strong> 作物和物品。非常适合希望整理农场和储藏室的玩家。</p>\n<h2>🌽 功能：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>箱子：</strong>可存放 <strong>朝鲜蓟</strong>、<strong>甜椒</strong>、<strong>玉米</strong>、<strong>黑莓</strong>、<strong>番茄</strong> 等多种作物。</li>\n<li><strong>袋子：</strong>适用于存放 <strong>黑豆</strong>、<strong>蓝莓</strong>、<strong>大米</strong>、<strong>橄榄</strong>、<strong>花生</strong> 等较小食材。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>✨ 无缝集成：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>只需收集 Croptopia 的物品，即可开始制作箱子或袋子。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/croptopia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此下载 Croptopia。</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>❤️ 支持我：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>通过&nbsp;<a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/bn9fZ\" rel=\"nofollow\">创建自己的 Minecraft 服务器</a>&nbsp;、&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 上捐赠</a>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Patreon 上支持我</a>&nbsp;，来帮助开发 <strong>Crate Delight</strong>&nbsp;及其插件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持我\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐赠\"></a></p>",
